Kunjamtï uñjtanxa , jakañatak wakiski uk Diosar mayiñax walikïskiwa .
Ukhamarus Diosan yaqha luqtirinakapaxa , mä wakiskir amtaru puriñataki jan ukax jan waltʼäwinakar saykatañatakix Juparuw mayisipxarakïna .
Juchanakasat pampachatäñatak Diosar mayisktan ukhaxa , suma chuyman jikxatasiñatakiw yanaptʼistu .
