Luisa sat mä kullakajj warmi sapakiw Diosar loqtaski . * Jupajj utan taqe lurañanakap phoqasaw jaqenakar Bibliat yatichirejj sarañ yati .
Akham sasin chʼamañchtʼañasawa : “ Bibliat yateqaskakim , jan jaytamti , inas qhepat amuytataschini ” sasa .
Chacha warmit mayni sapaki Diosar yupaychaskstan ukhajja , janiw jaljtañajj wakiskaspati . Jan jaljtapjjamti sasaw apóstol Pablojj amtayistu ( 1 Corintios 7 : 12 - 16 liytʼasiñapawa ) .
Kunapachatï jallojj wali jukʼat purjjati ukhajja , wali sumaw oraqerojj chʼachʼanti ukat alinaksa sum jiltayaraki . Ukar uñtasitaw chacha warmit sapaki tamar jutasipki uka jilat kullakanakarojj yanaptʼsna .
Ukampis nayarojj janiw jaqenakajj istʼañ munapkituti . Cheqasa , munas jan munasaw Diosan arunakapat parlir grabacionanak pachpa utanakapan istʼapjjäna .
