Pablon iwxtʼapax Diosan Reinop nayrar uchañatakiw yanaptʼarakistani , ukat alaxpachankir Awkisaw kunatï jakañatak munaski ukanak churistani sasaw atinisiñäni .
Kunjamanakatsa chiqapar lurañ munatasax yantʼat uñjasispa uk amuytʼañäni .
