Maysa toqetjja , Jehová Diosajj chuymasar purtʼañ munatapwa uka ewjjtʼanakajj uñachtʼayistu .
Jupasti , Diosan Qhanañchirinakapajj kunanaktï yatichapkta ukanakajj janiw aka colegiotakejj askïkiti sasaw säna .
‘ Llampʼu chuymanïsa ukat munasirïsa . ’
Niya 20 minutonak uñchʼukisipkayäta ukhaw maynejj jankʼak utar mantapjjam sapjjetu , ukat jankʼakiw proyector apthapisin mantapjjta .
Sañäni patonakajj janqʼokamakïpjjewa sasin yatjjataspa , ukampis mä urojj mä chʼiyar pato uñstaspa ukhajja , wasitamp yatjjatañapaw wakisispa .
