Juyphi pachanjja , thayajj uksar aksaruw mathapinak sartayi , ukat juntʼu pachajj janiw kuna mathapinakas utj - jjeti .
“ Qänarojj chawllajj phoqtʼänwa ”
Roma markanjja , niya ukar uñatasitarakwa militaranakataki ukat reyinakataki carta apayapjjerïna .
Uka arsutapar atinisiñatakejja , kawkïr profeciattï Diosajj Babilonia markan khä 2.500 maranaka nayrajj amuytʼaykäna uk yatjjatañäni .
