“ Ukhamatwa Diosajj taqe kunjjarus munañanïni ” .
Jesusan jiwäwipajj alajjpachatakisa , aka Oraqetakisa walja bendicionanakwa apanirakini .
Diosan Jehová sutipajja , kunjam Diosas ukwa amuytʼayistu . Jupajj wali yatiñani , wali chʼamani Diosawa .
Ukhamäkchisa Jesusan jiwatapajj Diosamp sum apasiñataki ukhamarak sutip jachʼañchañatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Jiwasasti alajjpachar sarañatak ajllit cristianonakar Diosan arunakap yatiyañ yanaptʼasaw uka Reinor yanaptʼtanjja .
Jilat kullakanakajja , “ taqe aka oraqpachana ” Diosan Reinopat yatiyasiñapjja sum yatipjjäna , ukatwa jan yatiyaskäna uka jaya markanakar sarapjjäna .
Wal chʼamachasipjjatapatwa Australiankir taqe markanakan yatiyapjjäna , ukhamatwa Diosan Reinop toqe saytʼasipjjañapatak walja jaqenakar yanaptʼawayapjje .
