Diosar taqe chuyma yupaychir levitanakarus uñjksna ukham amuytʼañäni , kunapachatï reyejj “ Tatituw jumanakarojj ajllipjjtam jupan arsutanakaparu phoqhapjjañamataki , servipjjañamataki ” sasin siskäna ukhajja , inas kusisiñat nayranakapat jachanakajj jalaranchïna ( 2 Cró . 29 : 11 ) .
Ezequías reyin arunakapaw markarojj chʼamañchtʼäna ( 12 ukat 13 tʼaqanak uñjjattʼäta )
Uka cheqatwa Jerusalén markankirinakarojj katuyasjjapjjakim sasin säna , uksti kimsa khita jaqenak toqew yatiyäna .
Kunapachatï Ezequías tiempon jakir judionakajj uñisirinakapamp Jerusalén markan muyuntat uñjasipkäna ukhajja , jan yanaptʼirinjamaw uñjasipjjäna .
Jupanakasti janiw Tatitur iyawsapkiti , jan ukasti jaqenakan sarnaqäwinakaparu , amtatanakaparukiw phoqhapjje kuna toqensa ” sasa .
Taqe ukanak toqew Jehová Diosajj uwijanakapar wali qhan ewjjtʼi .
Jesusajj akham sänwa : “ Alajjpachankir Awkimajj janiw khiti jiskʼan chhaqañapsa munkiti ” sasa .
Amuytʼañäni , Davitajj reyïñataki ukat Israel marka apnaqañapatak ajllitänwa .
Jan ukasti , israelitanakan irpirinakaparuw istʼapjjañapäna . Jupanakajja , Moisesajj kuntï qhan siskäna ukwa katoqapjjäna ( Éxo . 12 : 1 - 7 , 21 - 23 , 29 ) .
Uwijanakar Diosar yupaychañ toqet yanaptʼañat sipansa , Israelan kʼari yupaychäwi pʼeqtʼirinakajj “ jan aptkañ carganakwa ” apjjatapjjäna .
Irpir chuymaninakajj Diosan tamap uñjkasajj ¿ kunsa amtapjjañapapuni ?
Kuntï amtkani ukajj Jehová Diosampi sum apasiñatakit yanaptʼani janicha uk amuytʼasiñapatakiw chʼamañchtʼaspa .
Kunapachatï tamankirinakat yaqhepar ajay toqet yanaptʼañajj munasini ukhajja , ¿ kunsa irpir chuymaninakajj lurapjjañapa ?
Kunapachatï irpir chuymaninakajj jilat kullakanakamp jupanakatak Jehová Diosat mayirapipki ukat wakischi ukhajj jankʼak yanaptʼapjjaraki ukhajja , wali chʼamañchtʼir suma awatirinakäpjjatapwa uñachtʼayapjje ( Isaías 32 : 1 , 2 liytʼasiñapawa ) .
Irpir chuymaninakajj taqe luräwinakapan ‘ jachʼa awatir ’ Jesucristot yateqasiñatakiw chʼamachasipjje .
Millón millón jaqenakaw jan trabajon uñjasipjjäna .
Ukat Estados Unidos markan 1933 maranjj sapa urojj waranqaniw utanak aptʼasipjjäna .
Autotï gasolinanïchejja , jan kunat pächtʼasisaw Jehová Diosar confiyas nayrar sarantasipkakirïta ” sasa .
Jupanakajj janis Diosan yanaptʼap munapkaspa ukham amuyasipjje .
Jichhürunakanjja , walja yatjjattʼatanakaw aka toqenakat ewjjtʼañatak jankʼakïpjje : jaqenak pura sum apasiñata , munasiñata , familiata , jan waltʼäwinak askichañata , kusisiñ jikjjatañata ukat kunatsa jakastan ukanakata .
Diosan munañapajj phoqaspan sasin mayisipjjañapatakiw Jesucristojj arkirinakapar yatichäna .
Ukjjarusti , aka Oraqenjja ‘ janiw jiwañas utj - jjaniti ’ sasaw qhanañcharaki , ukhamasti jiwañajj jan mayampitakiw chhaqtayatäni .
Alajjpachanjja janiw jiwañajj utjawaykiti , ukampis aka Oraqenjja , niya qalltatpachaw utjawayi .
Ukat Leavenworth ( Kansas ) markaruw khitapjjetu .
Ukhamajja , ukar sarañatakejj mä barcon capitanapampiw mä amtar mantapjjta ; jupajj Estados Unidos markaruw nayar puriyañapäna , ukat pasaje lantejja , barconwa viajkasajj trabajañajäna .
Ukat 22 urunakaw lamar qotnäm barcot sarapjjta awisajj wali thayänwa , ukhampachas puripjjtwa .
Ukat kunapachatï aka Oraqejj mä suma paraisöjjani ukhajja , panpachaniw achachilanakajarusa , awk taykanakajarusa ukat Evarusa uñjañ munapjjta .
Punón ( inas jichhürunakan Feinan cheqächi ) cheqanjja , walja cobrew utjäna . Israelitanakajj wasarnäm sarkasin inas uka jakʼanakan maná sat manqʼata ukat uma jan utjipan Moisés contra parlapjjchïna .
Sacerdotenakan jarisipjjañapatakejj ‘ uma uchañwa ’ cobret lurayäna , ukarojja , 66.000 litronakaw umajj mantäna ukat 30 tonelada ukham jathïpachänwa ( 1 Reyes 7 : 23 - 26 , 44 - 46 ) .
