Jan ukasti , jupatakix sum sarnaqañax wali askïnwa .
Ukampis amay imäwix Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapan sarayatäki ukhaxa , wali askïspaw wawanakatakixa , ukhamatwa Bibliat apstʼat mä aski arstʼäwi istʼasin chuymachasipxaspa .
