Jupajj refaím tribut jutirïnwa , jupanakasti wali jachʼa jaqenakat uñtʼatänwa .
BIBLIAJJ AKHAM SIWA
Kawkikamatejj puedepkta ukakamajj taqenimpis jumanakajj sumankapjjam .
Ukampis Jehová Diosan Testigonakapajj utat uta yatiyirit uñtʼatätanwa .
Walja religionanakaw ‘ Diosan suma yatiyäwinakap nanakaw yatiyapjjta ’ sasin sapjje .
Yatiyirinakajj janiw yatiyatapat qollqe pagatäñ suyapjjañapäkiti ( Hechos 20 : 33 - 35 liytʼañataki ) .
Jan churatajj janiw ukanak lurasiñapatakejj permiso jankʼak churapkiti .
Jehová Diosajj libronaka , folletonaka , revistanaka ukhamarak yaqha ukham qellqatanak toqe yatichkistu ukanakjja , wali wakiskiritwa uñjtanjja .
Ukatjja , isinakajj sapa maratjamaw may may uñsti .
Biblia liyisasa jan ukajj yatjjatkasasa , akham sasaw jisktʼasiñasa : “ ¿ Kunsa Jehová Diosatsa , leyinakapatsa , kuntï amuyki uka toqetsa akajj yatichitu ? ”
Altʼat chuymanïñäni ukhamarak munasirïñäni ukhajja , mayninakajj isisitasat ewjjtʼapjjestani ukhajj istʼañäniwa .
Ukhamasti , kunanakatï jan walinak amuyañaru , jan ukajj jan walinak lurañaru apistaspa ukanakampejja , janipuniw kusistʼañasäkiti .
Maysa toqetjja , pantjasitanakasajj janis kunäkaspa ukham janiw amuyañasäkiti .
Ukhamajja Diosampi jarkʼaqayasiñatakejja idolonaksa , amuletonaksa , layqasiñ libronaksa , demonionakat “ jarkʼaqasiñatak ” pitanaksa , jan ukajj chʼankhanaksa ukhamarak kunanakatï demonionakampi mayachasitäki taqe ukanakwa apanukjjañama .
Jeremías tiempon jakir Israelitanakajja , janiw kuna tiemponsa jakasipkäna uk amuytʼapkänti .
Meaux cheqajja , París , Francia markat alay toqenkiwa . Jacques Lefèvre dʼÉtaples sat chachaw francés arur Biblia jaqokipäna ( latín arunjja , Jacobus Faber Stapulensis sasin uñtʼatarakiwa ) . Jupajja akham sasaw uka qhepat mä amigopar qellqäna : “ Pisin jakasir jaqenakarojj walpun Diosajj Arupa yatipjjañapatak yanaptʼaski ” sasa .
