Llakinakan jikxatasisaxa chuym ustʼayassnawa , ukhaman uñjasisax mä jaqix jan amuytʼasis kuns lurakispawa .
Diosat amtasir jaqichasitanakaxa walja bendicionanak katuqapxi .
