Ukat kuntï griego jaqenakasa , judio jaqenakasa ukat cristianopt sirinakasa taqe ukanakan amuyunakapaw ukan qhanañchasi .
Kunapachatï cristiano mä familiajj tamat jaqsutanakampi janipun chikachasipjjamti siski uka ewjjtʼar phoqañatak tamat jaqsut mä familiarapamp jan chikachasipki ukhajja , kuna askinaksa jikjjatsna uk jichhajj uñjañäni .
Sinti qarktan ukhajj cuerposajj aynachtʼiwa , ukhamarakiw mä cristianon chuymapajj aka jan wali pachan jakasa ukat trabajisajj aynachtʼat jikjjatasispa .
