Chiqpachansa , Jesusan pʼiqtʼatäsax wali chʼamañchtʼataw jikxatastanxa .
Ukhamasti , taqi iwxanakapar istʼasax Jesusarus istʼasksna ukhamawa .
Alaxpachankir awkisax iyawsäwisan sum saytʼatäñatakiw yanaptʼistu ukat chʼam churistu ukhamat ñanqha Supayar saykatañasataki .
