Ukajja , kunjamäsipktansa uk sum amuykiptʼasiñataki , kuna kasta munasiñatï cheqpach kusisiñ churistaspa ukham munasirïñasatakiw yanaptʼistani .
Jesusajj akham sänwa : “ Jaqe masimarojj juma kikparjam munasiñamawa ” sasa .
Biblia toqet yatjjatiri yaqhep jaqenakajj akham amuyapjje : ‘ Apóstol Pablojj qhepa urunakan kunjamäpjjanisa uka toqet qhanañchkasajja , jaqenakajj jupa pachpar añcha munasirïpjjaniwa sasaw nayraqat aytäna , kunattejj ukaw kuntï ukjjar qhanañchaskakïna ukham jan wali jaqer tukuyi ’ sasa .
Uka chachajja , billeterapat qollqe apsusajj jachʼa jachʼa tuktʼasaw akham säna : “ ¡ Akaw nayan diosajajja ! ” sasa .
Cheqas taqeniw qollqjja muntanjja , qollqejj yanaptʼarakistuwa ( Ecl . 7 : 12 ) .
Jichhajja , nayajj precursoratwa serviskarakta , panpachaniw mä sapa jefetaki , mä arunjja , Jehová Diosataki irnaqasipkta ” sasa .
¿ Jehová Diosaw kunatï wakiski ukanak churitani sasajj taqe chuymat confiytjja ? ”
Romanos 1 : 29 - 31 qellqatanjja , niya ukar uñtasit mä listaw utjaraki , ukampis apóstol Pablojj Timoteor qellqkäna uka cartanjja , Griego Arut Qellqatanakan jan utjki uka arunakaw uñsti .
Diosan servirinakapajja , janiw uka kasta jaqëpkaspati ( Malaquías 3 : 18 liytʼañataki ) .
Kunjamtï Biblian siskejja , Jehová Diosajj “ jachʼa jachʼa tukuñanaka [ rojj ] ” uñisiwa ( Pro . 6 : 16 , 17 ) .
Jaqenakarus Jehová Diosan Testigopätasjja yatiyañasarakiwa .
Janitejj ukhamäkani ukhajj Diosaruw jumanak contra mayisini , ukatsti jumanakaw juchañchatäpjjäta ” sasa .
¿ USUTA , qollqet pistʼata , jan waltʼayañatak arknaqata , yaqha ukham jan walinakanti uñjasta ?
Ukatwa Bibliajj “ kunatï cheqapäki uk yatiyiri ” sasin jupat qhanañchi .
Jupatakejja , mä jachʼa arca lurañajj chʼamakïpachänwa .
Diosajj Daniel waynar wal confiyäna , ukham confiyasajj janiw pantjaskänti .
Jiwasatï Jupar confiyañäni , humilde chuymaniñäni , istʼasirïñäni ukhajja , Jehová Diosajj munasirakistaniwa ( Hageo 2 : 7 ) .
Diosat jan jitheqtatapsa , Jupar taqe chuyma munasitapsa Job pachpa uñachtʼayañapatakiw Diosajj jaytäna .
Jiwasajj Job chachat sipansa , khitis Supayajja , kuna jan walinakampis yantʼistu uk sum yattanjja .
Jichha tiemponjja , Diosan markapajj ukham yatiñanïpjjarakiwa .
Liytʼasajja , Danielajj kunjam jaqënsa uk amuytʼañatakiw chʼamachasiñama .
Yatiñanïñaw jaqenakar istʼañat sipansa , Diosar istʼañ wakisitap amuytʼañatakejj yanaptʼäna .
Diosarojj akham sänwa : “ Parlata [ nak ] toqekwa uñtʼayäsmajja ” sasa ( Job 42 : 5 ) .
Jehová Dios pachpaw Job chachan arunakapajj cheqäskapuniwa säna ( Job 42 : 7 , 8 ) .
Ukhamasti , Job chachajj janiw wali uñtʼatätap laykusa , ni qamirïtap laykusa jilankkaspas ukham amuyaskänti .
Job chachatakejja , Jehová Diosar serviñaw taqe kunat sipansa nayrankäna , chuymapansa ukham amuyarakïna . Jupatï utjirinakapar jukʼamp munasispänjja , yaqha diosanakar adorañampi sasispänwa , uk sum yatïna .
Maysa toqetjja Proverbios 18 : 1 qellqatajj siwa : “ Khititejj jupatakiki kuns munki ukajja , munañaparukiwa sarnaqe , ukatsti taqe suma amtäwinak contraw tuku ” sasa .
Sañäni , inas warmejj chachapampi chikäsin jan chʼajjwañatak istʼchispa .
Wawanakamarutï jichhürunakan sum yanaptʼätajja , jupanakampejj jutïrin sum parltʼasïta .
Awk taykanakajja , jan wal uñjatäsin janiw jankʼakejj colerasipjjañapäkiti .
