Kunapachatï jupajj taqe chʼamani Jehová Diosan muspharkañ luratanakapata ukat kunjamsa markaparojj wali munasiñamp uñji , khuyaptʼayasi ukanakat parljjayatajj kunjak Rut tawaqojj istʼkäna uk amuysnawa .
