Servirinakapajj jan walinakar uñisiñasawa .
Jehová Diosajja , jan mayampis Babiloniampi katuntatäñapatakiw markapar yanaptʼani .
Uksti phoqarakïnwa .
Cheqas ukhamwa cantañ librosan utjki uka cancionanakampejj Jehová Diosar taqe chuyma cantañasa .
¿ Kunas yanaptʼistaspa ?
Yaqhep cancionanakasti , ‘ wali suma luräwinak jukʼamp utjañapataki ’ , maynit maynikam munasiñasatakiw yanaptʼistani .
Kimsa , juchapat arrepentisirinakan llakimpi jan aynachtʼapjjañapataki yanaptʼatäpjjañapatakisa , Diosaw jilïr irpirinakar yatichi ukhamarak ajlli .
Fariseonakajj janiw Jehová Diosjam khuyaptʼayasirïpkänti .
‘ Impuesto cobririnakata juchararanakat ’ yaqhepajj arrepentisiñ munapjjatap Jesusajj amuyänwa .
Aka qellqatajj oraqpachan Bibliat yatichañataki luratawa , uka yatichäwejja yanaptʼañ munirinakan donacionanakapampiw apasi , janiw aljasiñapäkiti .
Ukampis yaqha sacrificionakaw Diosar kusisiyaraki .
Mayninakar yanaptʼañatak chʼamachasisajj kusisitätanwa . Yamas Jehová Diosan bendicionanakapwa katoqtanjja , Jupampis sum apasiraktanjja , ukjja apóstol Pablojj jupa pachpaw uñjarakïna .
Sañäni , yaqheparojj mayninakat sipan suma amuytʼasirïkaspasa , jan ukajj jilankkaspasa ukhamwa amuyayaspa .
Ukampis uka jisktʼan qhanañchäwip yatjjatañajj janiw chʼamäkiti .
Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Taqe utas maynin luratawa , ukampis taqe kunas Diosan luratawa ” sasa .
Walja religionanakajja , Diosajj infiernonsa tʼaqesiykaspa ukhamwa yatichapjje , qollqe churapjjañapatakis obligapjje , politicarus mitisipjje ukhamäpjjewa , ukatwa walja jaqenakajj Diosar creyiñ jan munjjapjjeti .
Janiwa .
2 ) ¿ Kunas apóstol Pablor cheqpach kusisiñ churäna ?
Akapachankir jaqenakajj kuntï sapki ukajj Diosar confiyañat pächasiyistaspa ukhajja , Bibliajj uka toqet kamsisa uk yatjjatañasawa , experienciani jilatampi jan ukajj kullakampiw parltʼañasa .
¿ Kunanakatsa anatañanaka kusistʼañanak ajllkasajj amuyasiñasa ?
Saúl reyin Jonatán yoqapat amtañäni , Jehová Diosajj jupar ajlliñat sipansa , Davidaruw reyïñapatak ajllïna , ukhamäkchïnsa Jonatanajj janiw coleraskänti .
‘ Khuyaptʼayasirïñajj janiw aleq sinteqtʼasiñakïkiti , jan ukasti tʼaqhesitanakar yanaptʼañatakiw chʼamañchistu ’ sasaw mä librojj qhanañchi .
Khuyaptʼayasirïtap laykuw mayninakarojj munasiñamp parlirïna , yamas yaqhanakamp tʼaqhesiyat uñjasipkäna ukanakarojj jukʼampwa khuyaptʼayäna .
Inas mä viuda kullakajj utapan kun askichañatak yanaptʼa munchispa .
Maysa toqetjja , yaqhepajj wali jachʼa territorionïpjjewa , ukanjj waljaniruw Bibliat yatjjatañ munirinakar jikjjatapjje , ukampis jan taqenir yatiyirjamäsaw aynachtʼapjje .
¿ Kunjamsa jichhak bautisatanakarojj yanaptʼsna ?
Kuna askinaksa yatiykasasa , Bibliat sapaki yatjjatkasasa , jan ukajj familjam yatjjatkasasa jikjjatawayta uka toqenakatwa parltʼasma , jan ukajj tantachäwin kuna arstʼäwis chuymar purtʼawaytam uksa , parltʼarakismawa .
Jilat kullakanakajja , waljaniruw Mateo libro jaytapjje . Ukat kunapachatï wasitampi jupanakan ukar kuttʼapjje ukhajja , jaqenakajj ‘ jankʼakiw liytʼapjjta ’ sasaw sapjje . ¡ Yaqhepanakajj qʼalwa liysupjje !
Mä kullakajja , uka librwa mä tawaqor churatayna , ukatsti correopwa churarakitayna .
Mä semana qhepatjja , Bibliat yateqañwa qalltäna , ukat tantachäwinakarus sarjjarakïnwa .
Revistajj sarakïnwa : ‘ Maynikisa , paninisa jan ukajj kimsanisa mä pachpa iyawsäwinïpjjstajja , Tatitojj jumanakampïskaniwa ’ sasa .
Jesusan jiwäwip amtañatakejja , sapa maraw walja jaqenakajj Pittsburgh markar sarapjjäna .
Mä qawqha tiempotjja , wali sum amuytʼasaw Russell Poggensee jilatajj akham säna : “ Jehová Diosajj janiw qollan ajayupampejj alajjpachar sarañ munañ chuymajar uchkituti ” sasa .
Ukhamajj Criston jiwäwip amtaski uka urunakajja , kawkinkkasasa kunjamäskchiñäni ukasa , taqeniw Jehová Diosarusa , Jesusarus jachʼañchañ muntanjja .
Kunapachatï soldadonakajj katuntir sarapjjäna ukhajja , Jesusajj janiw imantaskänti .
Jesusan arkirinakaparojja , romanonakan sumankañapaw yatiyapjjañapatakejj yanaptʼäna .
Romanonakajj janiw thaknamak sarapjjerïkänti , jan ukasti qotnamasa , jawirnamas viajipjjarakirïnwa .
Walja maranak nayrajja , judionakajj katuntatäsin Asiria markar apataw uñjasipjjäna .
Cheqas Jehová Diosaw cristianonakarojj yatiyapjjañapatak yanaptʼawayi .
Suman jakasiñatakisa , yatichäwinakap jaqenakar yatiyañatakis Diosajj yanaptʼarakistuwa ( Isaías 48 : 16 - 18 liytʼañataki ) .
Payïr Jachʼa Chʼajjwäwi tukuyatarojja , janiw taqe markanakan sumankañajj utjkapunïnti .
Ukampis janiw ukhamäkiti , taqeniw jiwirïtanjja .
Uka arunakjja , apóstol Pablompi Silasampiw Macedonia markankir Filipos sat markan cárcel uñjiriru sapjjäna .
Diosarutï istʼaspäna ukat qoqatsa jan manqʼarakispäna ukhajja , wiñayatakiw jakaspäna , uk jupajj sum amuyäna .
Ukatwa juchajj jupjjar jan munañanïkänti ukat wiñayaw jakaspäna .
Jesusajj kuntï Adanajj aptʼawayki ukwa jakäwipamp alawayi . Ukhamat wiñay jakañasataki .
Apóstol Pablojj Corinto markankir cristianonakaruw uka toqet qellqäna .
‘ Nayraqat achu ’ jan ukajj jiwatanakat nayraqat jaktayata sasaw Pablojj Cristot sirïna , ukampejj waljaniw qhepat jaktapjjarakispa saskänwa .
Ukatwa jumarusa , familiamarusa , amigonakamarus uka arstʼäwi istʼapjjañamatak Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapajj invittʼapjjsma .
Mamitajajj walja kutiw hospitalar jankʼaki apirïna jiwatäjjpachaw sasa .
‘ Bibliat yateqakiniti janicha ’ sasaw sapa kuti jisktʼasipjjerïna .
Arsuyañ toqet yatjjatat mä qollirejja , ‘ Jairompi sum parlañatakejj jïsa jan ukajj janiwa sañjam jisktʼanak lurapjjam ukat nayraqatapar paypach amparanakam uskupjjam , ukhamatwa jïsa sischi ukhajj kupi ampar toqer uñtani , janiwa sischi ukhajj chʼeqa ampar toqer uñtani ’ sasaw ewjjtʼapjjetu .
Ukatwa 2004 maran aka wakiskir jisktʼa jisktʼapjjäna : “ ¿ Jehová Diosan munañap phoqañataki jakäwim Jupar katuyasiwayjjtati ? ”
Alex sat amigopajj akham siwa : “ Jairojj kuntï Biblia toqet arski ukajj sapa kutiw wal muspharayitu ” sasa .
Awatirejj qawqhay awatirjamächi ukarjamakiw awatiñ katoqerïna . Qawqha maranisa , orqoti qachucha ukanak qellqtʼasirïnwa .
Jesusajj jiwäwip amtañatak arkirinakapar nayrïr kuti siskäna ukhajja , mä arustʼäwitwa jan ukajj mä amtäwitwa parläna .
Cheqa yatichäwinak uñtʼapjjañapatakiw nayajj walja jaqenakar yanaptʼañ munayäta , ukatwa precursorjam irnaqañ qalltawayta .
Niyakejjay thoqhoñ yatipjjchiyätjja , familiar yanaptʼañatakiw thoqhoñ yatichañatak mä escuela jistʼarapjjta .
Kimsa , aka qhepa maranakanjja , Jehová Diosan markapajj Biblian yaqhep jiskʼa tʼaqanakap jukʼamp sumwa amuytʼjjapjje .
Amuytʼañataki , mä kutejj akham sänwa : “ Kunjamtejj Jonasajj mä jachʼa chawllan purakapankän kimsürumpi kimsa arumampejja , uka kikparakiw Jaqen Yoqapajj kimsürumpi kimsa arumampi oraq manqhankani ” sasa ( Mateo 12 : 39 , 40 liytʼañataki ) .
Taqe ukanakat yatjjatasin kun sañsa muni uk amuytan ukhajja , jukʼampiw Jehová Diosar confiytanjja .
¿ Kunjamsa Nabot chachan sarnaqäwipajj nayrajj qhanañchasïna ?
Ukampis jupanakajj khitimpi sasisa uk janiw qhanañchkiti , jan ukasti kunsa jupanakat yateqassna ukwa qhanañchi .
Walja toqenakata .
2 ) Jan amuytʼasir virgen tawaqonakjamäpkani ukanakarojja , ¿ kunas pasani ?
Ajllitanakat yateqasisajja , jan qarjtasaw cristianonakajj Diosan Reinopat yatiyapjjañapa .
Amuytʼañataki , Jesusajj jiwatat jaktasin arkirinakapar uñstäna uka arumajja , 153 chawllanakwa arkirinakapajj katsupjjäna sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Ukatjja , Elihú chachjamaw walja wayna jilatanakajj irpir chuymanjam wali yatiñamp irnaqtʼasipki .
Mateo 24 ukat 25 jaljanakan jikjjataski uka uñachtʼäwinakajja , ¿ kunanaksa qhanañchi ?
Jupanakatakejja ukham lurañajj wali askiwa .
Uk amuytʼañatakejja , kuna toqetsa Jesusajj parlaskäna uk uñjañäni .
Jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , Yatiyañataki julio 15 , 2013 revistan 7 , 8 jananakat 14 - 18 tʼaqanak uñjjattʼäta .
Kuttʼanjjasajja , wasitatwa uywatanakapar tantachthapi , ukatsti ¿ kunsa qollqempejj lurapjjta ? sasaw jisktʼi .
Ukampis mä uñachtʼäwit parlañajj utjaskakiwa .
[ . . . ]
Jichhürunakan Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapajj niya kimsaqallqo millonäjjapjjewa .
