Jilïr irpirinakajj ‘ jachʼa mathapi thayan imantasiñampi ’ sasiwa sasaw Jehová Diosajj säna ( Isa . 32 : 1 , 2 ) .
Jehová Diosajj Jesusan loqtasitapjjaruw juchanakas sapa maynir perdonistu , uka laykurakiw wiñay jakañ katoqsna , ukanakarojj taqe chuymaw confiyañasa .
