Nayrajj mayninakar jan waltʼayiri wali phiru jaqëyätwa , Diosan Arupaw jan ukham jaqëjjañatak yanaptʼawayitu .
México markan Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan sucursalapajj utjki ukansa mä qawqha maranak sirviwayaraktwa .
Biblia akham siwa : “ Jupaw jiwasar khuyapayasir Awkisajja , ukhamarak chuymachirisasa . Taqe tʼaqhesiñanakasanwa Diosajj chuymachistu ” sasa .
Jupanakajj jiwasjam pantjasirïpjjänwa , ukhamasti sarnaqäwinakapat liytʼañajja , kunjamsa mayninakamp suma apasiñatakejj chʼamachasipjjäna uk amuytʼañatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Departamento sarayiri jilatasti , jupar sum istʼasajj Bibliatwa mä qawqha qellqatanak liytʼarapïna .
Jichhajja , kunjamsa departamento sarayirejj pacienciampi ukhamarak munasiñamp jupar istʼäna uk amtapuniwa .
Ukham lurasatï jan waltʼayasitas jan askichkañäni ukajja , paninimpi jan ukajj maynimpiw sarañasa , jupanakasti cheqapunit jucha luratajj utji janicha uk qhanstayañatakiw yanaptʼapjjestani .
Ukatsti , Diosan arunakap yatiyaskakiñatakis yanaptʼarakistaniwa .
( Lucas 4 : 43 liytʼañataki ) .
