Awisajja , yaqhep religionanakajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapjamarakiw Diosan arunakap yatiyañ yantʼapjje , ukampis aynachtʼapjjewa .
Diosar servirinakajj jaqe masipar jupanak kikparjam munasiñatakiw wal chʼamachasipjje , janiw jupanakan chuymap ustʼayañ munapkiti , costumbrenakapsa respetapjjarakiwa .
Yaqhep markanakanjja , multa pagañajj utjki uk jan pagañ layku , jan ukajj leyinakarjam jan walïki uk jikjjatañatakiw policianakarusa yaqha ukham autoridadanakarus qollqe chilltañ yatipjje .
Ukhamajj kunapachatï irpir chuymaninakajj maynin tamar kuttʼanjjatapat yatiyapjjani ukhajja , respetompi amparanak tʼajjllirañajj walikïskaspawa .
Judionakajj costumbrenakaparjam qʼomachasiñatakiw uka estanquer sarapjjarakirïna .
Betzata estanque jakʼan yaqha estanque utjatap laykojja , umapajj pachpakïskiriwa , janiw saraqerïkänti .
Ukampis janiw taqpachpun sumpach liytʼktanti .
