Daniel profetan uñisirinakapajj Darío reyin ukar sarasin mä decreto apsuyapjjäna ukhajja , jupajj iyawsäwinitapa ukat jan ajjsarirïtap uñachtʼayarakïnwa .
Yaqhepajja Diosan Reinopat yatiyañat sipansa , kunanakampis qollasispa jan ukajj kunanak manqʼañas wakisispa ukanakakwa jupanakkam parlasipjje , ukhamatsa yanaptʼasipkaspa ukham amuyapjje .
Jichhürunakanjja , ukhamarakiw altʼat chuymanïtanti janicha ukajj yantʼat uñjasi .
