Kunapachatï yaqhep judionakajj Diosar taqe chuyma jan yupaychjjapjjatap amuyäna ukhajja , kunsa Nehemías chachajj luräna uk amuytʼañäni .
Mä kullakajj akham siwa : “ Kunapachatï irpir chuymanejj taqe chuymampi istʼktam ukhajja , wali chʼamañchtʼkiripuniwa ” sasa .
Ukat kunapachatï mä amigosa jan ukajj mä familiarasas llakinakap yatiyistani ukhajja , uka munasiñaw akanak lurañatak wiytistani : 1 ) taqe amuyumpi istʼañataki , 2 ) kunjamsa jikjjatasi uk amuyañataki ukat 3 ) jupar taqe chuyma khuyaptʼayañ munatas uñachtʼayañataki .
Janiwa , Bibliajj akham siwa : “ Kuntejj amtkatayna ukjja janiw chhaqtayaskänti , jan uñjkañ Diosarojj uñjkaspas ukhama ” sasa .
Ingersoll sat arstʼirejj akham sänwa : “ Jilaparte jaqenakajj jan waltʼäwinakjja , aguantakispawa ukampis pʼeqtʼirjam uttʼayasi ukhaw kunjam jaqëkitï ukajj qhan amuyasjje ” sasa .
Ukat niya jiwañap jakʼajja , chʼamanïskchïnsa Jehová Diosarojj naya lanti Israel marka pʼeqtʼañapatak ajllim sasaw mayïna .
Ukat familjam kun lurañatakis tiemp apstʼasipjjapunim ukat mä kunaks wawamajj “ sum lurani ” ukhajja , jupamp chik kusisipjjarakim .
Ukat Jehová Diosarus yanaptʼjja mayiñamarakiwa .
