Ukhamtï mayisiñänejja , Diosajj samarañap churapjjätam “ uka samarañasti jumanakan chuymanakamsa , amuyunakamsa imaniwa Cristomp mayakïpjjatam layku ” sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchistu .
Diosar yatiñ kankañap mayiñäni ukhajja , Jupajj qollan ajayup toqew suma amtanakar puriñasataki yanaptʼistaspa .
Jesusajj suma amtanakar puriñatakejj Awkiparuw mayisirakirïna . 12 apostolonakap ajlliñapäkäna ukhajja , “ jupajj arum paqariw Diosat mayisïna ” sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi .
Biblianjja , walja chʼamañchtʼkir yaqha qellqatanakaw utjaraki .
Ukampis janiw ukanakajj Diosar uñtʼañat jarkʼkistuti , antisas ukanakat lupʼiñajja , Jehová Diosar jukʼampi jakʼachasiñatakiw yanaptʼistu .
Mä arunjja , Diosajj janiw qalltanïkisa ni tukuyanïkarakisa , Jupajj wiñayatakiw utjani .
Inas uka doctoran wali suma amigopajj yaqha irnaqäwinïskchi .
