Yaqhep regalonakajj janiw jila alanïpkiti , ukampis mä familiaratï jan ukajj mä amigotï regalistaspajja , wali valoranitwa uñjaraksna .
Jichhürunakanjja , ukhamarakiw Diosajj servirinakapar wal munasi .
Nayratpachasa jichhakamas Diosakiw ukham suma regalo churawayistu .
Yuspärasirïñajj kunja wakiskirisa ukwa Jesusajj lepra usuni tunka chachanakar qollasajj yatichawayistu .
Jesusan jiwatapaw jiwañat qhespiyistu sasin iyawstan ukhajja , luratanakasampiw uñachtʼayañasa .
Kunatsa Jesusajj jiwawayi , jiwatapajj kunjamsa jichhasa jutïrinsa yanaptʼistaspa ukaw uka tantachäwin niya mä horan qhanañchasiskani .
Uka pachparakiw apóstol Pablojj “ Tatitun arunakap parlañ ” layku solterok qheparapkäna ukanakat parläna .
Ukat Bibliat apstʼat qellqatanak churasajja , Testigonakampi Bibliat yateqañapatakiw chʼamañchtʼäna .
Mä Testigojja , aka revista lurapki ukanakar qollqe apayasajj akham sasaw mä carta qellqäna : “ Aka maranakanjja mä qawqha qollqempikiw Tantachasiñ Utan yanaptʼawayta . [ . . . ]
Cheqas jukʼamp jaqenakatï maynit maynikama yanaptʼasipjjaspa ukhajja , taqeniw wali sum jakassna .
Bibliarjamajja , jaqenakajj ‘ Diosar uñtasit ’ luratätanwa , ukatwa Jupjam chuymanïtanjja ( Génesis 1 : 27 ) .
Jukʼamp yatjjatañatakejja , ¿ Kunsa Bibliax chiqpachapuni yatichi ? sat libro uñjjattʼäta , ukajj Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan luratawa .
Qhepa urunakanjja , jaqenakajj jan suma chuymani jan walinak lurirïpjjañapänwa .
Kunjamtï Bibliajj siskejja , Jesusajj Diosan kupëjjaparuw mä qhawqha tiempo suyañatak qontʼasïna .
