Bancor qollqe imasitama . Bancon imat qollqesa , qollqe imat documentonakasa , jubilasit qollqsa Jehová Diosan Testigonakapan sucursalaparuw katuyasispa , jan ukajj banconakatak leyejj utjki ukarjamaw churasispa , ukhamat churirejj jiwjjaspa ukhajj uka qollqe irtjjapjjañapataki . Accionanaka ukat bononaka .
