sasin jisktʼañajj janiw walïkaspati , uk jupanakakiw yatisipjje , jiwasan uk yatiñasajj janiw wakiskiti .
Ajllitanakan awk taykaparusa , esposoparusa , esposaparusa , mayni familiaranakaparusa , janiw akham jisktʼañasäkiti : ‘ ¿ Ajllitäpjjaraktati , jan ukajj janicha ? ’
Apóstol Pablojj akham siwa : “ Khitintejj munasiñajj utjki ukajj llampʼu chuymaniwa , suma jaqewa , janiw envidiasirïkiti , janiw jachʼa jachʼa tukurïkiti .
Jupanakarusa , esposanakaparusa wali respetompiw uñjañasa .
Maynin akatjamat jiwatapatjja , wali llakitäsajj maynejj colerampiw apayasispa .
Inas amigomar awistʼaschisma , jupaw sum istʼasin chuymachtʼiristam .
Ukajj wawajatakejj wali askipunïnwa , jupajj jan awkinëjjasajj ukham yanaptʼatäñ walpun munäna .
Ukatsti uka jiwatanakajj jaktapjjaniwa ” sasa .
Wila morado tiñiñ qollajja wali jila alanïnwa , ukajj qotan jakir molusconakatwa apsusirïna .
Ukatwa nayjam jan walin uñjasipki ukanakar Jehová Diosat wal yatiyañ munta .
¿ Isaac waynajj Rebecan chuymapar purtʼaniti ?
Ukhamajj taqpach camellonakar sistʼayañkamajja , walja horanakaw Rebecajj irnaqaspäna .
Eliezerajj familiapar yatiykäna ukhajja , inas Rebecajj istʼaskchïna , ukhamajj kunjamakis jikjjatasïna uk amuysnawa .
Kunjamtï Bibliajj qhanañchkejja , Rebecan familiapajj uwijanak awatirïpjjänwa , janiw camellonakampi sarir alakipanakapkänti ( Génesis 29 : 10 ) .
Abrahamajj jan wawanïkäna ukhajja , juparuw taqe kunsa jaytawayjjä sasaw säna .
Carcelat utar kuttʼjjayäta ukhajja , tatajan jarkʼatpachas paqallqoniw tantachäwinakar sarjjapjjatayna , mä kullakajas bautisasitaynawa .
Ukhat mä mara qhepatwa Isaac yoqapajj nasïna .
Uka tiemponjja Isaías , Miqueas , ukhamarak Oseas jupanakaw Israel markan profetäpjjäna .
Kunapachatï Asiria marka apnaqer Senaquerib reyejj Jerusalén marka tukjiri jutäna ukhajja , Ezequiasajj Jehová Diosar confiyatapa ukat jan ajjsarirïtapwa uñachtʼayäna .
Sofonías 1 : 14 qellqatajj akham siwa : ‘ Jehová Diosan jachʼa urupajj wali jakʼankiwa ’ sasa .
Ukhamajja , wakiskani ukhakiw jupanakar istʼañasa ( Romanos 13 : 1 , 2 liytʼañataki ) .
Ukampis Jehová Diosampiru Jesusampiruw taqe kunat sipansa nayraqat istʼañ munayäta .
27 : 11 ) . Janipun pächasiñäniti , Jehová Diosaw sum uñjaskistani , taqe kunsa jiwasan askisatakiw lurani .
