Ukatakejj janiw mä templor sarañasa ni idolonakar qonqortʼasiñajas wakiskänti ” sasaw jupajj qhanañchtʼi .
“ ARUNAKAMAJJ SARNAQÄWIJATAK QHANAWA ”
( Kayunakapasa ukat lukʼananakapasa , hierrompi ñeqʼempi kittatawa . )
Uka tiemponjja , ‘ Diosan ajllit wawanakapajj ’ jan inaktʼasaw Diosatak wal lurasipkäna , jukʼampis Estados Unidos , Brooklyn ( Nueva York ) markana .
Loretta kullakajja , wakichtʼat manqʼanak aljir mä empresanwa suma trabajonïna .
Angelanakajja , jaqenakat sipans jukʼamp chʼamanïpjjewa ukat alajjpachanwa jakapjjaraki .
Sajjranakajj jiwatan arupäkaspas ukham parlasaw jaqenakar sallqjjapjje ( Isaías 8 : 19 ) .
( Deuteronomio 18 : 10 , 11 ukat Hechos 19 : 19 liytʼäta . )
Uka markarojja , Babilonionakaw tʼunjani sasaw Jehová Diosajj säna , ukampisa mä suytʼäwi churarakïna : juchañchäwejja sapa maynirüniwa , mä arunjja , sapa maynejj lurataparjamaw juchañchatäni sasaw sarakïna ( 19 ukat 20 jiskʼa tʼaqanaka ) .
‘ Moab oraqenakajja ’ yapuchañatakejj wali sumapunïnwa , ukat Israel markan manqʼat pistʼañajj utjkäna ukhasa achuskakïnwa .
Munasiñampiw loqtirinakaparojj apnaqe , janiw ajjsaraykiti ( Deuteronomio 6 : 5 ) .
Inas mä alakip toqe akham siri istʼchïna : “ Israel markanjja , janiw manqʼat pistʼañajj utj - jjeti , Jehová Diosaw markapar khuyaptʼayjje ” sasa .
Diosajj jumanakat khuyapayaspan , kunjamatï nayatsa ukhamarak wawanakajjatsa jumanakajj khuyapasipkista ukhama ” sasa .
