Jesusax 1914 maranwa “ wali jachʼaru aptatän [ xa ] ” kunapachatï Jehová Diosax Jupan Apnaqäwipxaru ajllit Reyjama uttʼaykäna ukkha ( Sal . 2 : 6 ; Dan .
44 : 28 ) . Jichhaxa Uraqpachan yatiyasiñapatakiw pʼiqtʼaskaraki , ukhamat aka Uraqin jiltʼki uka ajllit jilanakaparusa ukat millón millón ‘ yaqha ovejanakjam ’ uñtʼatäpkis uka ‘ jiskʼa tamar ’ yanaptʼirinakarusa tantachaskaraki ( Apo . 12 : 17 ; Juan 10 : 16 ; Luc . 12 : 32 ) .
Ukatwa , jaqinakax wali sum katuqapxañapax wakisïna .
Jesusax “ [ usunakampi ] tʼaqhisiris yatitarak [ ïniwa ] ” sasaw Isaiasax säna .
Uka profecía sum amuytʼañatakix ak amtañasawa : Supayax Jehová Diosan apnaqäwipar qallasïna ukhaxa , Diosan luqtirinakapatxa janiw khitis alaxpachansa aka Uraqinsa jan jithiqtasa luqtapkaniti sasaw sarakïna ( Job 1 : 9 - 11 ; 2 : 3 - 5 ) .
