Ernesto : Ukajj walikipunïniwa .
Julio : Nabucodonosor reyejj mä jachʼa qoqampiw samkasïna , uka qoqajj alajjpachkamaw purïna .
Julio : Niyaw Diosan Reinopajj apnaqjje Jesucriston pʼeqtʼata , sasajj kutin kutinwa Daniel librojj qhanañchi .
