¿ Kunjamsa Jehová Diosampejj irpayastanjja ?
Ukhamächi ukhajja , Jehová Dios pachpas ewjjtʼkiristam ukhamwa katoqasiñama .
Ukhamasti , khitinakas trigor uñtasitäpjjäna uk janis sum yatkstanjja , nayra patak maranakatpachwa ajllit cristianonakajj aka Oraqen utjapunïna .
Jichhürunakanjja , awk taykanakajj ukham kusisitaw jikjjatasipjjaraki , kunapachatï wayna tawaqonakajj ewjjanakaparjam sarnaqapki ukhajja .
Juchararäkstansa , Diosar munasiñaw Jupajj kunjamäkitï uk uñachtʼayañatak yanaptʼistu .
¿ Kunjamsa Adanajj warmiparu uñjasajj jikjjatasïna ?
