Kunjamtï mä familian walja tiempo juntuki sarnaqapxi ukhax jukʼamp mayachasipxixa , ukhamarakiw tantachasisax Diosar yupaychirinakax jukʼamp mayachasipxi .
Jehová Diosan Qhanañchirinakapax chika semanax wasitampiw tantachasipxta .
Jesusax ukhamarakiwa , arkirinakapar janïr yatiyir khitkasax tantachtʼasin kunjamsa lurapxañapa uk yatichäna .
