Ukampis sapa mayniw horasapar sartani . Cristow nayraqata jaktejja nayraqata achur uñtata , ukjjarusti kunapachatejj Cristojj [ kuttankani ] ukkhajj jupar iyawsirinakarakiw [ mä arunjja , jupampi chika apnaqerinakaw ] jaktapjjarakini .
Betelar jichhak puririnakajja , familiapatsa amigonakapatsa llakisipjjaspawa .
Jupanakarojja , pachpa markankir sucursalawa jan ukajj tamawa utampisa , manqʼañampisa yanaptʼaraki .
Diosan Reinopajj apnaqjjani ukhajja , sapüruw Jehová Diosar servjjañäni , ukatakiw jichhürunakan ukham serviñajj wakichtʼaskistu .
Precursor especialanakajja , 130 horanakwa sapa phajjsejj Diosan arunakap yatiyapjje , ukat kawkhanakantï yatiyirinakajj jukʼamp munaski ukanakaruw khitasi .
Ukarjamaw walja jilatanakajj jukʼamp luräwinak jikjjatañatak chʼamachasisipki , ukhamatwa waljanejj irpir chuymanjamasa yanapiripjamasa servisipki .
Ukampis sapa mayniw uka lurañanak katoqañatakejj chʼamachasiñapa .
William sat jilatajj walja jilatanakaruw nayrar sartapjjañapatak yanaptʼatayna , jupasti siwa : “ Mayitanak phoqañatakejj tiempow munasi .
