Ukatwa yaqhanakan kusisit jakasipjjañapatak yanaptʼañ muntanjja , Jehová Diosaru uñtʼapjjañapatakisa , amtanakapat yatipjjañapatakis wal chʼamachasiraktanjja .
Ukampejj janis Jehová Diosar confiyjjsna uk janiw sañ munkiti , jan ukasti jaqenakar wal munatas laykuw ukham jikjjatastanjja .
