Kunapachatï Job chachajj ukham lurasin perdonañatak jankʼakïtap uñachtʼayäna ukhajja , Jehová Diosajj jupar bendicïnwa ( Job 42 : 10 , 12 , 16 , 17 liytʼasiñapawa ) .
Reyïkchïnsa , Jehová Diosajj cheqañchänwa ukat Natán profetaparuw kuna jan walinsa uñjasini uk yatiyañapatak khithäna ( 2 Sam . 12 : 1 - 12 ) .
Jonás chacharojj Diosajj akham sänwa : “ Sartam , Nínive jachʼa markaru sararakim , ukatsti yatiyanim , nayasti qʼalwa tukjä ñanqha luratanakapajj nayraqatajjaruw purinitu uka layku ” sasa .
Jehová Diosan cheqañchäwip taqe chuyma katoqtʼasipjjañäni ( Pro . 3 : 11 , 12 ) .
Ukhamatwa “ qarjata , jan chʼamani sarnaqasipki ” ukanakar chʼamañchtʼañatakejj wakiskir arunak jikjjatäta .
Uka jiskʼa tʼaqanakajj walja aski yatichäwinakwa Jehová Diosat yatichistu .
