Daca ( Bangladés ) markankir 35 maran Zulma * sat casada warmejja , munasiri , kusisit sarnaqtʼasiri , trabajtʼiri , jaqenakan Diosar uñtʼapjjañapatak yanaptʼirit uñtʼatänwa .
