Ukatwa Biblia liyktan ukhaxa , walja maranak nayra qillqasitap amtañasaxa .
Israel markan wali jayanak qarin qarin sarkasas Diosan arunakapat yatichapunirïnwa .
Jiwañapax niya jakʼankxäna ukhaxa , kunjamaksa Diosan munañap phuqäxa sasaw Jesusax wal llakispachäna .
Jïsa , Awkipan munañap phuqañ layku jiwañxa janiw Jesusax axsarkänti ; janiw akchʼas Diosan chuymap pʼakintañ munkänti . Janipuniw jichhakamax khitis ukham uñjasiwaykiti .
Jesusax akham sasaw taqhisiñ lawan jiwawayxäna : “ Taqi kunaw phuqhasxi ” sasa .
