Jiwasatï Jehová Diosar istʼañäni ukhajja , Jupajj jukʼampiw munasistani ( Deuteronomio 7 : 12 , 13 liytʼañataki ) .
Mä kutejja , akham sasaw mä fariseojj Jesusar jisktʼäna : “ Yatichiri , ¿ kawkïr mandamientos taqet sipansa wali jachʼajja ? ” sasa . Jesusasti juparojj qhanwa sarakïna : “ ‘ [ Jehová ] Diosamaruw munäta taqe chuymamampi , taqe almamampi , taqe amuyumampiraki ’ .
Akawa taqet sipansa jachʼa mandamientojja ” sasa .
