Uka jan waltʼäwi istʼasaxa Jilïr Irpirinakax mä amtäwiruw puripxäna ukat Pablompi yaqhanakampiruw yatiyapxañapatakix khitapxäna .
Ajllit cristianonakax mä cuerpopkaspas ukhamawa sasaw apóstol Pablox satayna , ukat kunjamtï uka janchin sapa chiqax jupanakkam yanaptʼasipxixa uka kikparakiw ajllit cristianonakaxa maynit maynikam yanaptʼasisa munasisa ukat kuna luräwtï Diosax jupanakar churki uks mayachtʼat lurapxaraki , sasaw satayna .
