Ukjjarusti , Jesusajj tunka virgen tawaqonakatwa parläna ( Mateo 25 : 1 - 13 liytʼañataki ) . Aka yatichäwinjja , uka toqetwa yatjjataskañäni .
Kunjamatejj uywatanakajj uywiriparu casarasïwit kuttʼaniñap suytʼapkejja ukhama ’ sasa . Uka arunakajja , kunsa tunka virgenanakajj lurapjjañapäna ukwa amtayistu . Jupanakajja , casarasir waynan puriniñapatakejj wakichtʼataw lamparanakas qhantayat suyapjjañapäna .
