Janitix Jesusamp sum apasksna ukhaxa , janirakiw Jehová Diosampix sum apasksnati ( Juan 14 : 6 , 21 liytʼasiñapawa ) .
Jesusax pisinkir ukat yaqhachat jaqinakampi sarnaqirit uñtʼatänwa ; janiw wali aytat qamir jaqinakamp sarnaqirit uñtʼatäkänti .
