Ukat kunapachatï Jehová Diosax munkani ukhaw ‘ taqi israelitanakax ’ , mä arunxa ‘ Diosan israelapax ’ alaxpachan reyinakjama ukat sacerdotenakjam lurañanakap phuqapxani .
Jupax aynachtʼatanakatsa , llakitanakatsa wal khuyaptʼayasi , ukatwa yugopar jawsi , mä arunx munasiñampi apnaqäwiparuw jawsaski .
