Jehová Diosamp chiktʼatäkiristsa ukham amuyasirïta ” sasa .
Janiw tamat jaqsutanakamp parlañasäkiti sasaw Bibliajj qhanañchi , uk jumajj sum yattajja .
Ukhamatwa Diosar confiyäta ukatsti Jupar istʼatamatjja taqe kunas walikïniwa .
Pablojj akham sänwa : “ Qhespiyasiñ arunak parlañajjataki , khitinakatejj Tatitur jan uñtʼapki uka jaqenakan istʼapjjañapataki ” sasa .
Julian jilatajj akham siwa : “ Yoqajajj wawajaskakïnwa , ukampis jan wali sarnaqatapaw jupampi sum jakasiñataki jarkʼapjjetäna ” sasa .
