Jumatï jukʼampi yatjjatañ munasma ukhajja , jakaskta uka cheqan jakir Jehová Diosan Testigonakapaw yanaptʼapjjeristam .
Jesusajj janïr jiwkasinwa , jupat jan jitheqtiri apostolonakapampi tantachasïna , ukanwa Santa Cena uttʼayäna .
Jaqenakajj amparanakapa lakap jarisipjje , ukatsti haiden ( oratorio ) sat cheqanwa amparanak tʼajjllisipjje , mayisipjje ukhamarak yupaychapjje .
Santuarionakar kayuk sarapjjatapjja , ¿ Diosajj askit uñjpacha ?
Ukhamasti , Diosar templonakana yupaychañat sipansa , Diosajj kunjamtï yupaychayasiñ munki ukhamarjamaw yupaychañasa , mä arunjja , Bibliajj kunjamtï yatichki ukarjama .
Aka qellqata katoqatamajj qawqsa Jehová Diosajj munastam ukwa uñachtʼayi , Diosajj “ janiw munkiti khitin chhaqañapsa , jan ukasti muniwa taqeninsa [ Jupar ] kutkatañapa ” .
Ukhamarus ‘ qollan qellqatanakan ’ janiw mä libroki utjkänti .
