Pablox akham qillqäna : “ Diosan arupasti jakaskiwa , jachʼa chʼamanirakiwa . Purapar arini espadat sipansa jukʼampi ariraki , ukasti almampir ajayumpirux jukʼamp manqhakamaw puri , lupʼïwinaksa , chuyman amtäwinakapsa qhanstayarakiwa ” sasa .
Ukaxa janiw kunjamtix mayninakax uñjkistu jan ukax kuntï jiwas pachpat amuyasktan ukhamapunïkaspati .
Ukampis ukham amuyañax janiw walïkiti . Pablox Corintonkir jilat kullakanakar qillqkäna uka arunakapatwa ukham amuyañax jan walïtap yatiraksnaxa , jupanakaxa wachuq juchan sarnaqirinaka , chacha pura jan wali sarnaqirinaka , machirinaka ukham jaqinakäpxänwa .
