Jiwasatï ukham jachʼa jachʼa tukurïsna ukhajja , ewjjanak katoqasajj colerasjjaksnawa , altʼat chuymampi ewjjanak katoqasiñat sipansa , janiw katoqasiñ munjjsnati ( Sal . 141 : 5 ) .
Janïr casaratäkasin yaqhanakampi ikthapir wayn tawaqonakajja , ukham lurapjjatapat qhepatakwa wal amtasipjje .
Ukatsti campamentopjja jachʼa qotampi , ukhamaraki Suma Oraqen qollan qollupäki uka taypiruw uttʼayasirakini .
Abraham , Isaac , Jacob chachanakajja , Diosar iyawsapjjatapatwa niyas uka Suma Oraqen wawanakapajj jakjjapjjaspa ukham amuyapjjäna .
Jupanakaw kunjamsa Diosajj esclavöñat qhespiyasajj servirinakapar Suma Oraqe churani uk yatichapjjpachäna ( Gén . 13 : 14 , 15 ; Éxo .
Amuytʼañataki , akapachajj ‘ jan waltʼañanakampi , qhathami sarnaqañampi ’ phoqantatäkchi ukasa , pisin jakasiri walja jaqenakajj jutïrin walja qollqeni jan llakini ukhamaw jakasiñ munapjje ( Sal . 90 : 10 ) .
