Ukampisa , ¿ kunjamsa yanaptʼsna ?
Jaqenakajja , kunjamsa jan waltʼäwinakap askichapjjaspa uk satäñak janiw munapkiti , jan ukasti , chuymachtʼatäñwa munapjje .
Maysa toqetjja , mayninakar yanaptʼasaw khuyaptʼayasirïtas uñachtʼayaraktanjja .
Ukhamarusa , tamankirinakajj Jehová Diosar munasipjjatap laykuw taqe chuym servipjjani sasaw confiyapjjaraki .
Kunjamtï uñjawayktanjja , Jesusajj altʼat chuymani , khuyaptʼayasiri ukhamänwa , ukatwa jupat yateqasiskakiñ muntanjja .
Yaqhep jilat kullakanakajja , walja maranakaw yatiyjjapjje ukat akapachan jan jankʼak tukusitapatwa aynachtʼapjjaraki .
Taqe ukanakaw maynirojj aynachtʼayaspa , ukatwa kusisit chuymamp jan yatiyjjaspati .
