Aka yatichäwinakaniwa
Jiwatanakajj cheqapuniw jaktapjjani sañatakejja , mayajj akarakiwa : Jehová Diosajj ‘ janiw kʼarisir ’ Diosäkiti .
Jehová Diosajja , Yoqaparuw jiwatanakar jaktayañatakejj chʼam churani , ukhamajj khitinakatï munat familianakap aptʼasiwayapki ukanakajj wal kusisipjjani .
SARNAQÄWI
Amigonakajampïñasa , uman tuyur sarañasa , pelot anattʼañas wal gustitäna .
Wali respetompis istʼirïkstjja , janiw uka toqet yatjjatañ munkayätti .
Kawkhantï usurnukstatanakar uñjapki uka uta walpun thaqasajja , Valencia sat markänwa jikjjatta , ukasti Alicante markat 160 kilometronak alay toqenkiwa .
Computadorjja , barbilla satäkis uka cheqampiw apnaqta , qellqtʼañatakejj mä jiskʼa lawar uñtasita varillaw yanaptʼitu .
