Jichhajj wasitampiw Juliojj irpir chuymanjam serviski .
Uka jilat kullakanakaw Diosan arunakap yatiyasa ukat cheqa yatichäwinak jaqenakar yatichasajj Diosar jachʼañchapjjañapatak ajllitanakar yanaptʼapjjaraki .
Kunjamtï pasïr yatichäwin uñjawayktanjja , Supayan apnaqat ñanqha pachapanjja , cheqa cristianonakajj yaqha markankirinakjama , jan ukajj ‘ sarir jaqenakjamätanwa ’ .
Jupajj akham sänwa : “ Uka reyinakan apnaqañapkamasti , alajjpachankiri Diosajj mä yaqha reino saytʼayarakini , uka reinosti janipuniw tukjatäkaniti ni apnaqatäkarakinisa yaqha markanakampejja , jan ukasti jupaw taqe yaqha reinonakarojj tukjani , wiñayan wiñayapaw uka reinojj utjarakini ” sasa ( Dan . 2 : 44 ) .
Uka yanaptʼajj uka markanakan jakasir jilat kullakanakatakikiwa .
Uka jiskʼa tʼaqanakarjamajja , Taqe kunjjaru Munañani Jehová Diosan ‘ yatichatajja ’ janiw “ maysarus uñt [ añapäkän ] ti ” .
Diosajj Oraq lurkän ukhajja , wali “ sumätapwa ” uñjäna , jichhakamas amtapajj ukakïskiwa ( Génesis 1 : 31 ) .
Biblianjja , akapachan tukusiñaparojj mä warmin parto usu sartayasitapampiw uñtayi , uka usojja mä akatjamatwa wal usuñ qalltjje .
Ukat yaqha urutï ukham suma amuyumpi kunas pasaski uk uñjaskakinejja , waljaninakaruw jiwañat qhespiyaspa .
