Colegionkir masinakapat sipansa , awk taykanakaw wawanakar yanaptʼapjjaspa , qʼajjo wayn tawaqöjjapjje ukhas yanaptʼasipkakispawa .
Ukhamajj jumatï pantjasisajj esposamatsa wawanakamatsa perdón mayisïta ukhajja , cheq parlaña humilde chuymanïñwa wawanakamar yatichäta .
Kunapachatï kunjam jaqëtas uk sum yatisjjta ukhajja , kunatï walïki ukpun lurtajja , janirakiw wayna masinakamampis apnaqayasktati .
Akham amuytʼañäni , utantï lurañanakamp yanaptʼäta ukhajja , familiamajj janiw sint qaripkaniti .
