Bibliajja , Diosajj akapachar wal munatap laykuw Jesús Yoqapar churasiwayi , ukhamat jaqenakar juchat qhespiyañataki sasaw sistu .
Niyakejjay Jehová Diosajj perdonasir Diosächejja , Jupampejj sum apasiskaksnawa .
Jehová Diosat yatesisaw yaqhanakar yanaptʼsna .
Bibliajj akham siwa : ‘ Servirinakapat maynitï lanktʼasini ukhajja , janiw tinkkaniti , Tatituw amparapat wayjjasiski ’ sasa ( Sal . 37 : 24 ) .
Ukatjja Diosan yanaptʼap munkäta ukhajja , uka toqet Jupar mayisim .
Jupampi yanaptʼayasiñ munirinakarojja , ¿ kunjamsa Diosajj suma jaqer tukuñatak yanaptʼi ?
Jilat kullakanakasar ukham uñjañatakejja , kunas yanaptʼistaspa uka toqetwa aka yatichäwin kimsa toqet uñjaskañäni . Maya , Jehová Diosajja , ¿ khitinakarus suma jaqer tukuñatak yanaptʼi ?
Ukhamasti , jilat kullakanakasatsa yatiyktan uka jaqenakatsa janiw jan walinak amuyañasäkiti .
Ukatsti , amuyunakapajj Diosatakjamäñapatakisa , Jupatakjam taqe chuyma sarnaqañatakis yanaptʼayasirakïnwa .
Ukatwa akham sas qellqäna : ‘ Khititejj chʼam churkitu ukan chʼamapampejj taqe kunaruw saykatirista ’ sasa ( Fili . 4 : 13 , NM ) .
1 ) Jehová Diosar sañu Luririrjam uñjasajja , ¿ kunjamsa jumajj jikjjatasta ?
Taqe kunjjar apnaqeri Jehová Diosajja , jupanakarojj neqʼerjamarakiw ñatjaspa , jan ukajj yanaptʼaspa , cheqpach cristianonakajj uk sumwa yattanjja ( Jeremías 18 : 6 liytʼañataki ) .
17 : 9 ) . Ukhamasti , mä jilatasa jan ukajj mä kullakas chuym ustʼayawaychistu , jan ukajj taman luräwinak katoqktan ukanak aptʼasstan ukhajja , ¿ kunjamakis jikjjatastanjja ?
8 : 11 ) . Pornografía uñchʼukiñar yatintatäkäna uka mä jilatajj akham sarakiwa : “ Jan amuyasisakiw irpir chuymaninak contrajj jan walinak parljjayäta ” sasa .
Diosan arunakap yatiyañaw suma jaqëñatakejj yanaptʼarakistaspa .
“ Diosasti mä sapakiwa ” siski uka arunakajja , Jehová Diosajj confiykañawa , kuntï arski uksa phoqapuniwa sañwa munaraki .
Jan ukajja , inas akapachan ‘ jachʼa cosasanaka ’ jikjjatañ laykojj universidadanakaru sarañ munstan ( Jer . 45 : 4 , 5 , NM ) .
16 , 17 . 1 ) ¿ Kuna profecías jichhürunakan phoqasiski ? 2 ) Uka profecía phoqasitapatjja , ¿ Diosan markapajj kunjamasa ?
Jesusasti sarakïnwa : ‘ “ Tatit [ Jehová ] Diosamaruw munäta taqe chuymamampi , taqe almamampi , taqe amuyumampiraki ” .
Jiwasatï uka tiempon jaksnäna ukhajja , Davitaru jan walinak lurir uñjasajj ¿ kunjamakis jikjjatassnäna ?
Ajllkäna uka apostolonakapat maynïrejj Judas Iscariotënwa , qhepatsti jupajj Jesusaruw aljantäna .
Isaías 65 : 14 qellqatanjja , akham sasaw Diosajj arsuwayi : ‘ Markajajj kusisiñatsa qʼochusipjjaniwa , chuymanakapan kusisiñajj utjatap layku ’ sasa .
Diamante sat qalanakarojja , jaqenakajj wali askitwa uñjapjje .
Jupajja , hebreo cristianonakar akham sas qellqañapatakiw apóstol Pablor amuytʼayäna : “ Orapjjamay nanakataki . Yatisipjjaraktwa nanakan chuymanakajjajj walikïskatapa taqe kunans sum sarnaqañ munapjjatanakajj layku ” sasa .
Ukampis jichhajj kusisitaw jikjjatasta , Jehová Diosampis sum apasirakta , wawanakajatakis yateqaskayarakïtwa , tamansa luräwinakwa katoqarakta .
¿ Aka qhepa phajjsinakan Yatiyañataki sat revista mistkäna uk liytʼtati ?
Antisas Biblianjja , Pedror jachʼañchañat sipansa , Jesusaw taman ‘ esquin qalapajja ’ sasinwa qhanañchi .
33 : 13 ) . Diosan servirinakapajj maynit maynikam yanaptʼasisin Diosan arunakap yatiyapki ukamp sasiwa .
