▪ “ Jukʼampi iyawsañ yaptʼapjjeta ”
Jupajj janiw israelitäkänti , ukampis kunjamsa Jehová Diosajj israelitanakar Egiptot qhespiyäna uk sumwa yatïna . Kunapachatï Jericó marka uñaqeri pä chachanakajj Rahab warmin utapar puripjjäna ukhajja , Rahab warmejj jupanakar sänwa : “ Nayasti yattwa Diosan jumanakaru aka oraqe churatapa ” sasa .
Amuytʼañataki , Filipinas markankir mä islanjja , Allan sat mä jilataw Diosan arunakapat yatiykasin mä warmir jikjjatäna .
Hebreos 11 : 6 qellqatajj akham siwa : “ Janiw Diosarojj jan iyawsañampejj kunapachas kusisiyksnati ” sasa . Ukhamajja jachʼa tʼaqhesïwit qhespiñatakejj Diosaruw iyawsañasa .
Ukatwa Jupar taqe chuyma iyawsiri servirinakapan sarnaqäwinakap Biblian qellqayawayi . Uka servirinakat yaqhepajj akanakawa : Abraham , Sara , Isaac , Jacob , Moisés , Rahab , Gedeón , Barac .
Ukhamajj iyawsäwisan jan aynachtʼañap munstan ukhajja , sapüruw Biblia liyiñasa , yatjjatañasaraki .
Kunanak lurasas Diosar taqe chuyma iyawsatas uñachtʼaysna uk jichhajj mä qawqha yatjjatañäni .
Jan waltʼäwinakan aguantasajja , Jehová Diosar taqe chuyma iyawsataswa uñachtʼaytanjja ( 14 tʼaqa uñjjattʼäta )
