Ukat yaqhanakajj akham sapjjarakiwa : ‘ Khitinakatï jan sum yatkas mä kasta jaqenakat jan wal amuyapki ukanakäpjjarakiwa ’ sasa .
Janqʼo jaqenakamp chikaw jilsuwayta ukhamatwa Asia toqenkirinakarojj jukʼat jukʼat uñisjjayäta , jumkʼampis chinonakaruw uñisiyäta .
“ Jichhajj cheqpachanwa amuyta , Diosatakejj taqe casta jaqes mayakïtapa ” [ mä arunjja , jan yaqhacharïtapa ] sasa .
Ephrem Mtsire chachajj Giorgi chachan mitaparakïnwa , jupajj jukʼamp nayraruw sartäna : mä arut yaqha arur jaqokipirinakatakejj mä yanapwa lurawayarakïna .
Uka qellqatanakajj palimpsestos satawa , ukat griego arut jaqokipatajj “ mayamp borrsuta ” sasispawa .
‘ Uka santonakajj jiwasjamaw yantʼanakana ukat jan waltʼäwinakan uñjasiwayapjje , ukhamajj istʼapjjestaniwa ’ sasinwa yaqhepanakajj amuyapjje .
Ukat wawamajj juman yanaptʼam munasajj ajjsarañat yaqha jaqe toqnam mayisiristam ukhajja , ¿ kunjamakis jikjjatasisma ?
Jupajj wal liyirïna ukat kuna aski yatichäwinaksa jan ukajj chʼamañchtʼkir arunak jikjjatirïna ukhajja , wali kusisitaw awistʼapjjerïtu .
¿ Kunjamatsa mä jan uñtʼat manqʼajj jiwasatak sumäspa ? Nayraqatjja , muktʼañasawa ukatjja malltʼañasawa , ukjjarusti jiwasaw phayañasa .
