Jichhürunakanjja , Bibliat taqe yatjjatirinakaw ukham lurapjjañaparaki : jachʼa jachʼa tukuñat sipansa , altʼat chuymampiw kuntï Bibliajj sañ munki uk amuytʼañataki Diosar mayisipjjañasa .
