Ukhamajj juchachastan ukhajja , Diosar jan munasitaswa uñachtʼaytanjja ” sasa .
Jesusajj janipuniw Jehová Diosat jitheqtañ munkänti , ukampis Supayajj janiw ukhamak jaytkänti , jan ukasti “ jan kunjämat Jesusar yantʼar puriyirjamäsajja sarawayjjänwa mä qawqha urunakataki ” .
Jichhürunakanjja , ukhamarakiw Supayajj Jehová Diosan leyinakap pʼakintayañ munistu .
Supayan yantʼanakapar saykatañatakejja , Jehová Diosajj qollan ajayupampiw yanaptʼistu . Ukatsti , chʼamasa , tiemposa ukhamarak qollqesa jan ina chʼusar aptʼasiñatakiw Biblia toqesa tamap toqes ewjjtʼistu .
Jupajj tiempopan jukʼakïtap yatisisajj wali coleratawa , ukatwa Diosarojj “ ñanqhatjja qhespiyapjjeta ” sasin mayiskakiñasa ( Apo . 12 : 12 , 17 ) .
Ukhamajj jan walinakan jikjjatasisajja , irpir chuymaninakamp yanaptʼayassna ukwa Jehová Diosajj muni .
Uka arunakapajj phoqasipunïnwa ( Gén . 40 : 1 - 22 ) .
Yaqhepasti , doctorajj cáncer usunïtaw siskitanicha sasaw ajjsarayasipjje .
Paul chachajja , familiapan jan manqʼat jiwapjjañapatakejj kunatï wakiski ukanakwa lurañapäna ( Proverbios 3 : 21 ) .
Jupajj akham saskakiwa : “ Jesusajj akham sänwa : ‘ Jan llakisipjjamti kunatï qharürojj paskani ukatjja , qharürusti taqe uka llakisiñanakapampi phoqtʼatarakïniwa , sapürurakiw ukham llakinakan phoqhantatäski ’ sasa .
Cheqas kuntï Jesusajj siskäna ukajj phoqasïnwa , Diosajj kuntï arski ukjja , phoqapuniwa .
