Jesusan yatichäwinakapa
Ukatwa Jesusax akham säna : “ Akanak pasir uñjapkäta ukkhaxa , yatipxam Diosan reinopax jakʼankatapa ” sasa .
[ Qhanañchäwi ]
Ukat kunjämapunis jupax uk jan yatxatapxañapatakisa ukhamaraki chiqpachansa Diosax kunjamasa uk jan amuyapxañapatakiw jaqinakan amuyunakap chʼamaktʼayaraki .
Luräwinakapat wali sum lupʼikiptʼasaxa , Diosan bendicionanakapar iyawsatap amuyasïna ukampis costumbrenakapampi jan walinakat jarkʼaqayasiñatakix thaqhaskakitapsa amuyasirakïnwa .
