Kunjamtï mä mapajj kawkinsa jikjjatastan uk yatiñatakisa ukat kawkirutï puriñ munktan ukar puriñatakis yanaptʼkistojja , ukhamarakiw Bibliat apstʼata qellqatanakajj kuns lurasktan uk amuytʼasiñatakisa ukat wiñay jakañar apiri thakit jan saranukuñatakis yanaptʼistu .
