Jan istʼañ munirinakajj tukjataw uñjasipjjäni .
Ukampis janiw ukakïkiti , jaqenakar yatiyir sarasin Diosar munasitas uñachtʼayasajja , wali kusisitaw jikjjatastanjja .
Ukat kawkinkkasas jaqenakar yatiyañasarakiwa . Ukatakejj wakichatäñasawa .
