¿ Khitin askipamp phuqtʼataw sisa ?
Jan yäqasiri , jan Diosarus iyaw siri jaqinaka ukat yupaychäw tuqit yatxatirïptwa sir kʼari cristianonakaxa , mä tawaqux jan chachanix janipuniw wawanïkaspati sapxiwa .
Moisesaxa , sutimxar parlañatakix janiw sum parlirïkti sasaw säna ( Éxodo 4 : 10 ) .
