A . MacDonald sat coronelajj akham sasaw uka cheqankir mä jilatar säna : “ Cabo Bretón islankirinakajj wasürojj wali suma yatiyäwpunwa istʼapjje , janipuniw ukham suma yatiyäwejj istʼasirïkiti ” sasa .
