1 ) ¿ Kunsa Jesusajj ‘ jachʼa tʼaqhesiñat ’ säna ?
Kunapachatï Supayajj Diosan markapar tukjañ munkani ukhajja , ¿ Jehová Diosajj kamachanisa ?
Tiempompejja , khitinakatï aka Oraqen jakasipkani uka jilat kullakanakaw Diosan arunakapat yateqawayapjjaraki , ukhamatwa Diosan markapajj jukʼamp jiljjattawayi .
Jichhürunakanjja , ukhamarakiw Diosan leyinakapasa yatichäwinakapasa wali sum jakasiñ yanaptʼistu .
Agosto 2012 maranjja , cigarro jan sinti fumjjapjjañapatakejj mä 175 markanakaw chʼamachasiwayapjje .
Nicotinajj chʼamanjam tukuyi , ukat aynachtʼayarakiwa .
Maynitï mä urun cajetillpacha pitaspajja , 200 kutis nicotinampi qolljaskaspa ukhamäspawa , mayni droganakat sipansa jukʼamp jan waliwa .
‘ Mä cigarrojj janiw kuns kamachkitaniti ’ sasaw qalltan amuyäna .
Uka manqʼajja , garbanzonak kʼiyjata ukat tomate , cebolla ukat yaqha ukhamanakamp kittatänwa , ukat ukasti , pita sat tʼantʼa manqhar uchatänwa .
Sarajj ratukiw uka tʼantʼa lurpachäna , inas parintat qalanakar qhatiychïna ( 1 Reyes 19 : 6 ) .
Kunattejj Ur sat markat mistjjasajja , janiw mayawjanak jakjjapjjänti , ukhamajj Sara warminsa uywatanakapansa janiw Ur markanjam tʼantʼa lurañataki hornopajj utjjänti .
Cheqas israelitanakatakejj ‘ alajjpach tʼantʼajj ’ ajjtaskaña jan walïkaspas ukhamäjjänwa ( Salmo 105 : 40 ) .
Tʼantʼasa ukat yaqha ukhamanakas , ina ukhamataks utjkaspa ukhamwa jaqenakajj amuyapjje .
Ukjjarusti tʼantʼa qhatiyapjjañapänwa .
Ukatakejj jakʼjja umampiw kittapjjerïna , chapjapjjerïna ukat qhatiyjjapjjerïna ( Génesis 18 : 6 ) .
